    "3397b495-a7d9-4a75-9551-fdf2f92d48e0": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "5284320f-2015-4065-bb46-1d6075e0bf59": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "award",
            "title": "Certified Company",
            "text": "<p>ISO 9001 & ISO 14001 Certified Organization. See all our certificates<a href=\"/pages/press\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Press Kit\"> here. </a></p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "bbdd1cd0-3090-4663-8b34-ffd8a60ee2da": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "calendar",
            "title": "10 Year Warranty",
            "text": "<p>Monteiro Fabrics with the longest guarantee on the market. This feature applies to all our stock service materials and on current brand products that carry a 10-year Warranty logo.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "template--18726128484655__439b45b3-5b3c-4ab1-8c3f-c8bb1b21e89e-1681821953b414edf0-0": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "scissors",
            "title": "Tailormade Solutions",
            "text": "<p>Our bespoke capacity provides answers to specific design and technical requirements, guaranteeing functional and aesthetic solutions. Know more <a href=\"https://www.monteirofabrics.com/pages/tailormade\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tailormade\">here.</a></p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "template--18726128484655__439b45b3-5b3c-4ab1-8c3f-c8bb1b21e89e-1681821953b414edf0-1": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "title": "Worry Free",
            "text": "<p>Our customers have described us as a Worry-free company. We strive to make the ordering process as seamless as possible, ensuring that our customers receive their orders promptly and without any unnecessary complications or hassles. Easy peasy!</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "template--18726128484655__439b45b3-5b3c-4ab1-8c3f-c8bb1b21e89e-1681821953b414edf0-2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "dryer",
            "title": "Colour matching",
            "text": "<p>With our state of the art colour-matching technology, we can match the colour of your sample. We can also provide a lab dip for your approval or a pilot sample.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "51c874e6-105d-4076-871f-58e7232cf38e": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "map_pin",
            "title": "Made in Portugal",
            "text": "<p>We manufacture all of our fabrics in Portugal, utilizing our own state-of-the-art facilities. Our supplier selection process is rigorous, exclusively partnering with European providers to ensure top-notch quality.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
